{
  "name": "One fill that both burns and mints",
  "rules": ["E-10.6", "E-11.1", "E-11.3", "E-15.2"],
  "notes": [
    "Prelude: A sells 3 YES from flat to C at 60c (A holds 3 NO, balance 10000 + 180 - 300 = 9880). D sells 2 YES from flat to B at 45c (B holds 2 YES, balance 9910).",
    "Step 1: B offers 5 at 50c. Lock min(5, 2) = 2; reservation noCost(49, 5 - 2) = 300 - 150 = 150.",
    "Step 2: A bids 5 at 50c. Lock min(5, 3) = 3; reservation yesCost(49, 5 - 3) = 100.",
    "The fill of 5: bBurn = min(5, 3) = 3, sReduce = min(5, 2) = 2, burned = min(3, 2) = 2, minted = 5 - max(3, 2) = 2.",
    "buyerCash = -250 + 100 * 3 = +50; sellerCash = 250 - 100 * (5 - 2) = -50. Collateral changes by 100 * (2 - 2) = 0.",
    "A goes from 3 NO to 2 YES; B from 2 YES to 3 NO. Every state still pays 500 in total."
  ],
